### 1. Obtener Token de USUARIO (ROLE_USER)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "usuario",
  "password": "123"
}

### 2. Obtener Token de ADMIN (ROLE_ADMIN)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "admin",
  "password": "123"
}

### Listar productos (Requiere Token)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/productos?page=0&size=10&sort=nombre,asc
Authorization: Bearer <COPIA_EL_TOKEN_AQUI>

### Crear producto (ROLE_ADMIN)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/productos
Authorization: Bearer <TOKEN_ADMIN>
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "nombre": "Arroz",
  "categoria": "Granos",
  "stock": 100,
  "precio": 1.50
}

### Error de validacion 400
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/productos
Authorization: Bearer <TOKEN_ADMIN>
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "nombre": "",
  "precio": 0.00
}

### Eliminar producto
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/v1/productos/1
Authorization: Bearer <TOKEN_ADMIN>

### Producto no encontrado 404
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/v1/productos/999
Authorization: Bearer <TOKEN_ADMIN>
